'''にゃんこ生態リポートデカ盛''' (''Nyanko Seitai Ripōto Deka Sakari'', '''Nyanko Ecology Report Large Edition''') is a Japanese manga that was published on April 24th, 2019 by [[wikipedia:Kadokawa Corporation|Kadokawa]].

