==Overview==
An illustrated book of the weird cat characters!

An illustrated book containing all the cat characters from "The Great Cat War".

This book is a must-have for all "The Great Cat War" users, as it contains the characteristics of each cat, as well as data that cannot be found in the game.

<<Highlights of this book>>
*More than 600 cats are included in the book.
*The status of the final form, which has never been shown in the game, is introduced with a 10-point rating.
*An evaluation of the attack speed of each cat, which has not yet been released in the game.
*You can see at a glance the attributes and attack range of each cat.

