==Trivia==
*According to this book, [[Coppermine (Uber Rare Cat)|Coppermine]] is a reference to [[Mari Illustrious (Super Rare Cat)|Mari Illustrious]] from ''Rebuild of Evangelion'', while [[Marauder Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Berserker Cat]] was modeled after Necky the Fox, mascot of the gaming magazine ''Famitsu''.

